WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:01.230
- Let's wind down the hour

00:00:01.230 --> 00:00:03.810
with something super fun from
the pages of social media.

00:00:03.810 --> 00:00:04.875
This is #WHAT I'M LIKING.

00:00:04.875 --> 00:00:06.444
(upbeat music)

00:00:06.444 --> 00:00:08.250
(applause)

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:09.615
It's been an hour of superheroes

00:00:09.615 --> 00:00:11.970
and I wanna close out with one more.

00:00:11.970 --> 00:00:14.910
A Dallas attorney making a
statement on female empowerment.

00:00:14.910 --> 00:00:17.218
She opened an all pink
immigration law firm.

00:00:17.218 --> 00:00:20.070
Nearly all the 22 employees are women

00:00:20.070 --> 00:00:21.653
and yep, they often all wear pink.

00:00:21.653 --> 00:00:23.640
She's a real life Elle Woods,

00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:25.590
And we have Kathleen on
the line right now watching

00:00:25.590 --> 00:00:27.960
on NBC 4 Dallas-Fort Worth at three.

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:29.584
What's up Kathleen?

00:00:29.584 --> 00:00:31.320
(applause)

00:00:31.320 --> 00:00:32.760
- Hi, nice to meet you.

00:00:32.760 --> 00:00:33.930
- [Kelly] Nice to meet you as well.

00:00:33.930 --> 00:00:35.070
So this idea came

00:00:35.070 --> 00:00:38.250
after experiencing just
tons of sexism, right?

00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:39.083
- Absolutely.

00:00:39.083 --> 00:00:42.150
So even as a paralegal or an
associate attorney myself,

00:00:42.150 --> 00:00:44.271
I was constantly degraded

00:00:44.271 --> 00:00:47.370
felt to, or made to feel
like I was lesser than

00:00:47.370 --> 00:00:50.490
because of my femininity or
the way I expressed myself.

00:00:50.490 --> 00:00:54.390
So starting my forum was
really a way for me to

00:00:54.390 --> 00:00:57.270
kind of embrace my femininity
in a way that I wanted to

00:00:57.270 --> 00:00:59.378
which is obviously
embracing the color pink.

00:00:59.378 --> 00:01:00.600
- [Kelly] I love it.

00:01:00.600 --> 00:01:01.590
And you were in fact

00:01:01.590 --> 00:01:03.600
inspired by Elle Woods character, right?

00:01:03.600 --> 00:01:04.801
In Legally Blonde?

00:01:04.801 --> 00:01:06.000
- That is correct.

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:08.280
So Elle Woods came out when I was a kid

00:01:08.280 --> 00:01:09.780
and I love the movie obviously

00:01:09.780 --> 00:01:11.370
because the philosophy behind it,

00:01:11.370 --> 00:01:13.050
which is really that you can be

00:01:13.050 --> 00:01:14.226
smart or taken seriously

00:01:14.226 --> 00:01:15.867
and you can be feminine.

00:01:15.867 --> 00:01:17.220
You can be smart,

00:01:17.220 --> 00:01:18.480
you don't have to be boxed

00:01:18.480 --> 00:01:20.460
in a certain stereotype
to be taken seriously

00:01:20.460 --> 00:01:21.390
or to practice law.

00:01:21.390 --> 00:01:22.500
So I love Elle Woods.

00:01:22.500 --> 00:01:23.333
I'm all about it.

00:01:23.333 --> 00:01:24.420
- [Kelly] Oh, I love that too.

00:01:24.420 --> 00:01:26.070
I see your kiddo picture
in the background too.

00:01:26.070 --> 00:01:27.360
Super cute!

00:01:27.360 --> 00:01:28.740
Thank you so much, Kathleen.

00:01:28.740 --> 00:01:30.391
I'm liking your post right now.

00:01:30.391 --> 00:01:32.442
(applause)

00:01:32.442 --> 00:01:33.570
- [Kathleen] Thank you.

00:01:33.570 --> 00:01:34.403
- All right.

00:01:34.403 --> 00:01:35.760
That's not all, our season long partner

00:01:35.760 --> 00:01:37.735
Pilot Pen makers of FriXion,
the Go-to Erasable Pen

00:01:37.735 --> 00:01:38.910
of the Kelly Clarkson Show

00:01:38.910 --> 00:01:41.672
want to celebrate those creating
fearlessly just like you

00:01:41.672 --> 00:01:43.174
so they're gonna give you
a thousand dollars just

00:01:43.174 --> 00:01:44.876
for being you.

00:01:44.876 --> 00:01:46.296
(applause)

00:01:46.296 --> 00:01:47.744
- Thank you.

00:01:47.744 --> 00:01:48.720
- [Kelly] Absolutely.

00:01:48.720 --> 00:01:50.850
Well, thank you so much
to all our guests today:

00:01:50.850 --> 00:01:53.198
Dwayne Johnson, Pierce
Brosnan, Aldis Hodge,

00:01:53.198 --> 00:01:57.190
Noah Centineo, Quintessa
Swindell, and Mika Elle.

00:01:57.190 --> 00:01:58.350
Y'all have a great day.

00:01:58.350 --> 00:02:00.100
And if it's not, try and change it.

